The user will ask something like: "I'd like to prepare for my annual physical. I'm 60, with osteopenia (apixaban 5mg twice daily and metoprolol 25mg), anemia (gabapentin 300mg), and a history of heart failure. My PCP is Dr. Sarah Chen ..."

Use topic-level wording in the rule you want stored (e.g. "taxes, filing, deductions, IRS" not just "taxes") so it generalizes to other phrasings.


